 "source_type": "instagram",
 "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfEkeZZSqGa/",
 "title": "Cold Email Strategy with Free Lead Magnet",
 "topic": "sales",
 "summary": "The creator shares a cold email strategy that improved reply rates by offering a free lead magnet. By building a tool that solves a prospect's problem, she was able to turn cold outreach into warm conversations.",
 "key_points": [
  "Put a lead magnet in your very first cold email, such as a document, video, or agent that the recipient can actually use.",
  "Target companies that are already emailing you but landing in your spam folder.",
  "Send a no-pitch outreach message letting them know their email landed in your spam folder and offer access to a free tool to diagnose why their cold emails fail.",
  "Track everyone who uses the lead magnet and follow up to offer help fixing their outbound process.",
  "This strategy resulted in 7 warm conversations that would not have happened with cold emailing alone."
 ],
 "content": "One cold email strategy that can seriously improve your reply rates. Put a lead magnet in your very first cold email. This could be an agent, a document, a video, anything they can actually use. For example, we built a free agent that shows you exactly why your cold emails are not working. So here's how I did it without hiring any extra team members like developers, designers. I just described my idea to Manus, confirmed the logic, added winning cold email templates that we got over the years of running cold email campaigns. We just created the entire web app with a database and a data dashboard and deployed it live with just one click. Then what I did was looked at companies that are already emailing me but landing in my spam folder. And then I send them this: 'Hey [name], your emails landed in my spam folder today. I built a free agent that shows you why your cold emails fail. Happy to send it over.' No pitch or anything. So my leads started using the agent because it solved a problem they already had. Then I tracked and followed up with everyone who used it, offered it to fix their outbound. And that got me replies like this. And this campaign turned into seven warm conversations that never happened with just cold emailing alone. You can copy this exact model in any niche. Doesn't matter. If you want the agent, the prompts, the full funnels just comment 'Agent' and I'm going to share it with you.",
 "status": "done",
